    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Sitting at the Throne</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;My cat sat perched high upon on the shelf, looking down at me with such distaste, and it was in that moment that I realized; I am but a mere mortal, filthy, peasant under the rule of an omnipotent, high-held being. - Me&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OR&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Catra sits in Glimmerâ€™s throne in a moment of absolute power and a god complex for a brief moment while her friends are gone, leading to highly unexpected consequencesâ€¦ for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
